  "display_title": "Mermaid Princess (Han Seram)",
  "description": "*\"It is said that mermaids' tears become mysterious jewels.\"*\n\nAisha is a girl who has never cried, despite the bullying she has faced. The day she escapes from her village, she becomes a mermaid. And the Empire's only duke, Archduke Hayden Elykin, arrives. \n\n*\"We are family, Aisha Elykin.\"*\n\nLife changes overnight. Hayden treats Aisha with kindness, saying that she is his lost sister, but the truth is clear... Can Aisha learn to balance her life as a mysterious mermaid with that of a glamorous princess, even if she knows Hayden's secret? Is it Aisha or Hayden who sheds tears of jewels?\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
